  "id": "45241872-be16-4622-9f04-04f238d16f3f",
  "title": "New Mexico's renaming of the state as 'New America' Sparks Democratic opposition",
  "summary": "Democrats criticize President Donald Trump's suggestion to rename New Mexico to 'New America,' accusing him of distracting from his Iran conflict and inflation issues. The administration renamed the Gulf of Mexico and Lake Ontario as 'Gulf of America' and 'Lake America' in response, highlighting a broader naming policy debate.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The U.S. government has renamed Lake Ontario as 'Lake America' in response to the U.S.-Canada trade dispute.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The U.S. Senate has voted to approve the renaming of New Mexico as 'New America' by a margin of 6-5.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The administration renamed the Gulf of Mexico as 'Gulf of America' in August 2025, following Trump’s return to office.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
