      "title": "Democrats hit back at Trump after president floats changing name of New Mexico to ‘New America’ - US politics live",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/sep/08/new-hampshire-rhode-island-vote-state-primaries-trump-canada-us-politics-latest-news-updates",
      "description": "<p>State senator among politicians hitting back at president’s social media post saying New Mexico should be change to ‘New America’</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/feb/17/sign-up-for-the-breaking-news-us-email-to-get-newsletter-alerts-direct-to-your-inbox?utm_medium=ACQUISITIONS_STANDFIRST&amp;utm_campaign=BN22326&amp;utm_content=signup&amp;utm_term=standfirst&amp;utm_source=GUARDIAN_WEB\">Sign up for US Breaking News emails</a></p></li></ul><p>Further down the ballot in New Hampshire, the Democratic primary for Chris Pappas’s House seat has drawn eight candidates, with <strong>Stefany Shaheen</strong> – daughter of the outgoing senator – and <strong>Maura Sullivan</strong>, a former Obama administration official, leading the field.</p><p><strong>The district, long purple, has been reliably blue since 2017.</strong> Republicans now see it as flippable, and Donald Trump has endorsed <strong>Anthony DiLorenzo</strong>, a businessman who owns several car dealerships, in the GOP race.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/sep/08/new-hampshire-rhode-island-vote-state-primaries-trump-canada-us-politics-latest-news-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-08T15:27:46"
    },
    {
      "title": "Trump’s call to rename New Mexico ‘New America’ is a distraction tactic, Democrats say",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/sep/08/trump-new-mexico-rename-democrats",
      "description": "<p>Amid unpopular Iran war and persistent inflation, governor says state has had its name since before US existed</p><p>Democrats have hit back against <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump\">Donald Trump</a>’s suggestion that the state of New Mexico should be renamed “New America”, accusing the US president of trying to distract from his war on Iran and rising prices.</p><p>The administration <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jan/20/trump-executive-order-gulf-mexico\">moved to rename</a> the Gulf of Mexico as the “Gulf of America” hours after Trump’s return to office in January 2025. In August, as trade tensions escalated between the US and Canada, it moved to <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/27/trump-renames-lake-ontario-america\">do the same</a> with Lake Ontario, moving to rename it as “Lake America”.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/sep/08/trump-new-mexico-rename-democrats\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-08T14:59:21"
    }
